│prerequisite is missing. CLI require declares prerequisites before a task starts.                 │
│                                                                                                  │
│Defaults apply to new tasks; existing revisions stay pinned.                                      │
│u User defaults: what new projects start with; preview and apply them here.                       │
│f Profiles: named role models to reuse; select one here or as the new-project default.            │
│w Work categories: templates that tell AI turns how to execute, review, validate and remediate    │
│code, documents or art; override per project.                                                     │
│L Review lenses: opt-in specialist reviews (concurrency, security, simplicity or your own) and the│
│project's default selection.                                                                      │
│Checks: list, add, edit, enable or disable.                                                       │
│Keyboard remains available with mouse disabled.                                                   │
│i Report limits: time and cost of agent reports and fixes; their model is the operator role in m  │
│Defaults.                                                                                         │
